{"seq":7,"slug":"advertising-brand-communication","title":"广告学与品牌传播","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 广告学与品牌传播 简介\n\n广告学与品牌传播是传播学中商业应用最为广泛的研究领域，探讨商业信息如何通过创意策略和媒介渠道影响消费者的认知、态度和行为。从传统广告的大众传播时代到数字营销的精准投放时代，广告传播的理论和实践经历了深刻变革，但创造品牌价值和建立消费者关系的核心目标始终如一。\n\n本知识库面向从事品牌管理、数字营销、广告创意和市场传播的中高级专业人士，帮助读者系统掌握广告传播的理论基础、品牌建设的战略方法以及数字广告的技术与实践。\n\n全书分为三章，从理论到战略再到数字实践：\n\n第一章**广告学理论**介绍广告传播的核心理论模型，讲解广告效果的层级模型、消费者心理学的基本原理以及广告伦理的规范框架，帮助读者理解广告如何在认知和情感层面影响受众。第二章**品牌战略**聚焦品牌建设的系统方法论，涵盖品牌构建的战略路径、品牌叙事的传播技巧以及品牌资产的评估与管理，为读者提供从品牌创建到品牌增值的完整知识体系。第三章**数字广告**深入分析数字时代广告传播的技术变革，探讨程序化广告的运作机制、社交媒体广告的策略特征以及内容营销的传播逻辑。\n\n建议读者先从广告学理论建立学科认知基础，再通过品牌战略理解长期品牌建设的方法论，最后学习数字广告掌握当代广告实践的核心技能。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advertising-theory","title":"广告学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/advertising-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advertising-models","title":"广告模型","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/advertising-theory/advertising-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-psychology","title":"消费者心理","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/advertising-theory/consumer-psychology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"advertising-ethics","title":"广告伦理","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/advertising-theory/advertising-ethics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"brand-strategy","title":"品牌战略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/brand-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brand-building","title":"品牌构建","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/brand-strategy/brand-building"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brand-narrative","title":"品牌叙事","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/brand-strategy/brand-narrative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"brand-equity","title":"品牌资产","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/brand-strategy/brand-equity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-advertising","title":"数字广告","docCount":3,"url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/digital-advertising","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programmatic-advertising","title":"程序化广告","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/digital-advertising/programmatic-advertising"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-advertising","title":"社交媒体广告","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/digital-advertising/social-media-advertising"},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-marketing","title":"内容营销","url":"/h/media-communication/advertising-brand-communication/digital-advertising/content-marketing"}]}]}